<section
  class="wwb-section wwb-toolkit"
  id="our-toolkit"
  aria-labelledby="wwb-toolkit-title"
>
  <div class="wwb-shell">
    <p class="wwb-eyebrow"><span>04</span> OUR TOOLKIT</p>
    <div class="wwb-section-intro wwb-intro-split">
      <h2 id="wwb-toolkit-title">
        Technology is a means.<br />
        <em>We use whatever the problem demands.</em>
      </h2>
      <p class="wwb-lead">
        We don’t begin with a technology and search for somewhere to use it. We begin with a
        problem and assemble the capabilities required to solve it.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="wwb-toolkit-system">
      <svg class="wwb-toolkit-network" viewBox="0 0 1100 700" aria-hidden="true">
        <defs>
          <linearGradient id="toolkit-link">
            <stop stop-color="var(--brand-blue)" stop-opacity=".08" />
            <stop offset=".5" stop-color="var(--brand-teal-light)" stop-opacity=".8" />
            <stop offset="1" stop-color="var(--brand-blue)" stop-opacity=".08" />
          </linearGradient>
        </defs>
        <ellipse cx="550" cy="350" rx="440" ry="205" />
        <ellipse cx="550" cy="350" rx="350" ry="135" transform="rotate(-24 550 350)" />
        <ellipse cx="550" cy="350" rx="350" ry="135" transform="rotate(24 550 350)" />
        <path d="M550 350 550 35M550 350 160 170M550 350 80 350M550 350 940 170M550 350 1020 350M550 350 250 610M550 350 850 610" />
      </svg>

      <div class="wwb-toolkit-core">
        <div class="wwb-toolkit-orbit wwb-toolkit-orbit-a"></div>
        <div class="wwb-toolkit-orbit wwb-toolkit-orbit-b"></div>
        <div class="wwb-toolkit-orb">
          <span>THE</span>
          <b>PROBLEM</b>
          <small>
            Every problem is unique. The right solution isn’t found in a toolkit—it’s assembled
            for it.
          </small>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="wwb-toolkit-capabilities">
        {[
          [
            '01',
            'AGENTIC AI',
            'Intelligence that can understand, reason, plan, and act.',
          ],
          ['02', 'SOFTWARE', 'Robust, scalable systems purpose-built for impact.'],
          ['03', 'DATA', 'Clean, connected, and contextualized for better decisions.'],
          ['04', 'AUTOMATION', 'Workflows that remove friction and unlock scale.'],
          [
            '05',
            'HUMAN EXPERTISE',
            'Domain knowledge and experience that ground the solution in reality.',
          ],
          ['06', 'RESEARCH', 'Deep domain research that uncovers what really matters.'],
          [
            '07',
            'EMERGING TECHNOLOGIES',
            'We continuously explore what’s next—so we can build what works.',
          ],
        ].map((item, index) => (
          <article class={`wwb-capability wwb-capability-${index + 1}`}>
            <span>{item[0]} / CAPABILITY</span>
            <h3>{item[1]}</h3>
            <p>{item[2]}</p>
            <i aria-hidden="true"></i>
          </article>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="wwb-toolkit-foot">
      <b>There is no fixed stack.<br /><em>Only the right combination.</em></b>
      <span>
        Our advantage isn’t any single technology.<br />
        It’s our ability to orchestrate the right combination<br />
        for the problem in front of us.
      </span>
    </div>
    <a class="wwb-next-link" href="#why-education">NEXT: WHY EDUCATION, NOW? <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a>
  </div>
</section>
